# frame,0xKEYINPUT synthetic input trace - mash Start/A/B/dirs.
# Generated 2026-09-17 to reproduce a real crash a headless idle run (zero
# input) never hit in 60,000 frames: a hard abort in runtime_arm.cpp's
# generated call-return stack (kCallReturnStackSize=1024), reached only
# once real input pushes execution into menu/gameplay code around
# 0x0815A000-0x0815A400. Reproduces in well under 40,000 frames with this
# trace (headless, ~1 real minute) vs. requiring several real minutes of
# actual play. Run with:
#   GBARECOMP_INPUT_REPLAY=oracle_diff/mash_input.trace \
#     ./build/KnightOfLodisRecomp --rom totkol.gba --bios <path> \
#     --no-window --frames 40000
# See README.md/CLAUDE.md for the open-bug writeup.
